# Rock Point Technical Services - Environment Variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values from your Lovable Cloud backend.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lovable Cloud (Supabase) - REQUIRED
# These come from your Supabase / Lovable Cloud project connection.
# They are public (publishable/anon) values and are safe to ship in the browser.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-publishable-key
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-ref

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: Third-party integrations
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you add external APIs (Resend, SendGrid, Google Analytics, etc.):
# - Do NOT paste private API keys below.
# - Store them via Lovable Cloud Secrets so they are encrypted and server-only.
# - Vite env vars (VITE_*) are bundled into the browser and are NOT safe for secrets.
#
# Examples of what you should manage in Lovable Cloud Secrets instead of .env:
# - Email service API keys (SendGrid, Resend, etc.)
# - OAuth client secrets
# - Backend signing keys
# - Payment provider secrets
#
# For public/config values only (e.g. a public PostHog project ID, a public Google tag),
# uncomment and set the matching VITE_* variable below:

# VITE_GOOGLE_TAG_MANAGER_ID=GTM-XXXXXXX
# VITE_POSTHOG_PROJECT_KEY=phc_xxxxxxxx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - Never commit `.env` to git. This `.env.example` is safe to commit because it
#   contains only placeholder values and documentation.
# - LOVABLE_API_KEY is auto-provisioned by Lovable Cloud and should not be
#   added or edited here.
# - VITE_SUPABASE_* values are public by design; Row Level Security (RLS) protects
#   the data in your database.
